# shell: desktop
# IV-053: a drag carries a PICTURE of what it holds.  Nothing was drawn at
# the pointer at all, so a drag begun in one window and finished in another
# was one the user had to remember the contents of.
wait 8
note picked up and carried over empty backdrop
press 100 136
move 400 400
move 700 300
wait 2
note the pointer carries the icon, translucent over what is behind it
expect-pixel 700 300 66777c
note put back where it came from, so what is checked is the picture and
note not what a drop does
move 100 136
release 100 136
wait 6
expect-pixel 700 300 336698
quit
